{title:BNR annual report Step 2: Approve the candidate}

{title:What this step does}

{pstd}
Step 2 records human approval of the exact annual-report candidate reviewed
after Step 1. It creates a public-ready package but does not publish it.

{title:Before you run it}

{pstd}
Review the complete Step 1 package and record the disclosure review. Confirm
that the report PDF, public-health update, website page and metadata are ready
for release and have not changed since review.

{title:What to enter}

{phang}{bf:Report year and version} must match the reviewed Step 1 candidate.

{phang}{bf:Full name and role} identify the authorised approver.

{phang}{bf:Review confirmations} must be ticked only after each stated action
has actually been completed.

{title:After running}

{pstd}
Confirm that the candidate is approved but not yet published and that the
approval receipt and manifest were created. Continue to annual report Step 3
only when publication is authorised.

{title:Full instructions}

{pstd}
See the {browse "https://uwi-bnr.github.io/info-hub/technical/workflows/reporting/annual-report.html":Technical Manual: Build, approve and publish an annual CVD report}.
